<title>USA: Pearland, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce Refsnes.</title>
<headline>Pearland, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce Refsnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $6.250 million of Pearland, Texas, limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997,with a net interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
</text>
